  "instructions": [
    "In a preheated mug, combine the sugar cube, Gardenia Mix, and the spice pinches.",
    "Add 3 strips orange peel and 1 strip grapefruit peel, then the hot coffee, and stir until the mix dissolves.",
    "FIXME: rum quantities are uncertain — the community book index lists demerara rum, gold Jamaican rum and Lemon Hart 151 as separate calls, but the available web transcription only splits 1/2 oz aged Jamaican + 1/2 oz 151 demerara; modeled as 1/2 oz gold Jamaican + 1/2 oz demerara + 1 tsp Lemon Hart 151 pending the book's exact spec.",
    "Combine the rums in a fireproof ladle, ignite carefully, and pour flaming into the mug. Garnish with a cinnamon stick."
  ],
